{"id":14597,"author":"dilpickel","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHello dilpickel here and I bring you my eighth map!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 48px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; font-size: 36px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eSlap fight!\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eMap Name\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e: Slap fight\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eMap Gamemode\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e: Nebula TDM.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eMap Creator\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e: dilpickel.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eIntro:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eIn this colorful\u0026nbsp;Team death match, slap you enemies around with all kinds of fish. Try to stay on the top and knock others to their death. If you get knocked off you could land on the platform below with other survivors battling to stay on.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eInfo:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThere are 4 loadouts to choose from:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eClown fish\u003c/b\u003e: Move fester: Speed 2, no armor, knockback 1,\u0026nbsp;and jump boost 2.\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eFish\u003c/b\u003e: Extra knockback: Knockback 2, bad food (cookies) no Gapples \u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;mining fatigue 1 slowness 1 and hunger 2.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePuffer fish:\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;Poison your enemies\u003cb\u003e: \u003c/b\u003e2 splash poison 1 (0:33)\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003esplash regeneration 1(0:33),\u0026nbsp;1 splash heal 2,\u0026nbsp;light armor (leather), feather fal\u003cb\u003el 5\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eand 2 jump boost 2.splash. (not finished)\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eSalmon:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eHit harder: Sharpness 3,\u0026nbsp;medium armor (leather enchanted) feather fall 5\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eDownload:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/rcgtlkl6qghhb4x/Slap_Fight.zip\" title=\"Link: http://www.mediafire.com/download/rcgtlkl6qghhb4x/Slap_Fight.zip\"\u003ehttp://www.mediafire.com/download/rcgtlkl6qghhb4x/Slap_Fight.zip\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;yaml:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://pastie.org/private/vs7hrlo4navka2wp5br1zg\" title=\"Link: http://pastie.org/private/vs7hrlo4navka2wp5br1zg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003ehttp://pastie.org/private/vs7hrlo4navka2wp5br1zg\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-heigh