ing at the bottom hurts my eyes, maybe add some design to it?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo far, +0.5","body_tagged":"The colorful thing at the bottom hurts my eyes, maybe add some design to it?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo far, +0.5","created_at":1435435291},{"id":202419,"author":"Subscriptor","body":"Really undetailed and it really isn't pleasing to the eye. However I like the idea, just could change the colors.","body_tagged":"Really undetailed and it really isn't pleasing to the eye. However I like the idea, just could change the colors.","created_at":1435436666},{"id":202425,"author":"Thomas_Shoe","body":"2 Brite 4 m3","body_tagged":"2 Brite 4 m3","created_at":1435438877},{"id":202443,"author":"Zintenka","body":"Seems like it would offer pretty unique gameplay. Provided that every one has no fall damage and that they have jump boost II or III.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHowever, the map doesn't really look... eh... but I will hold out on giving your map a +1 or a -1. This map has a lot of potential and things can be implemented to make the map really fun ;)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUpdate: Also, you might wanna boost the sharpness of the Salmon to sharpness 3 (.25 less damage than a wooden sword.)","body_tagged":"Seems like it would offer pretty unique gameplay. Provided that every one has no fall damage and that they have jump boost II or III.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHowever, the map doesn't really look... eh... but I will hold out on giving your map a +1 or a -1. This map has a lot of potential and things can be implemented to make the map really fun ;)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUpdate: Also, you might wanna boost the sharpness of the Salmon to sharpness 3 (.25 less damage than a wooden sword.)","created_at":1435443364},{"id":202459,"author":"Petlas","body":"As well as the mildly unappealing design, the colours could easily result in a lag-fest to top off the lag from the potion effects. Although I'm personally hyped for the gameplay, maybe edit up the structure/patterns?","body_tagged":"As well as the mildly unappealing design, the colours could easily result in a lag-fest to top off the lag from the potion effects. Although I'm personally hyped for the gameplay, maybe edit up the structure/patterns?","created_at":1435445043},{"id":202461,"author":"dilpickel","body":"lots of work to be done but does this look better or am I way off track?\u003cbr\u003eAlso great feedback again\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Zintenka\" style=\"color: rgb(109, 181, 104); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/Zintenka\"\u003eZintenka\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;I'll add jump boots to some or all classes. 3 out of 4 have feather fall and I'll add sharpness 3 to the salmon.\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ZgwnBhi.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/ZgwnBhi.png\"\u003e","body_tagged":"lots of work to be done but does this look better or am I way off track?\u003cbr\u003eAlso great feedback again\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Zintenka\" style=\"color: rgb(109, 181, 104); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/Zintenka\"\u003eZintenka\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;I'll add jump boots to some or all classes. 3 out of 4 have feather fall and I'll add sharpness 3 to the salmon.\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ZgwnBhi.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/ZgwnBhi.png\"\u003e","created_at":1435445440},{"id":202582,"author":"dilpickel","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eADDED: Better looks.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); f